<card id="c" title="Useful MacOS Apps for Developers">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p><b>Useful MacOS Apps for Developers</b><br/><small>10.02.2021</small></p>
<p>1. <a href="https://www.iterm2.com/">iTerm2</a></p>
<p>iTerm2 is a replacement for Terminal and successor to iTerm. It runs on Mac with macOS 10.12 or later.</p>
<p><i>Useful addition - syntax highlighting with <a href="https://github.com/zsh-users/zsh-syntax-highlighting">zsh-syntax-highlighting</a></i></p>
<p><i>Even more useful addition - Zsh prompt with <a href="https://github.com/denysdovhan/spaceship-prompt">spaceship-prompt</a></i></p>
<p><i>Font with symbols - <a href="https://github.com/tonsky/FiraCode">FiraCode</a></i></p>
<p>2. <a href="https://www.spectacleapp.com/">SpectacleApp</a></p>
<p>An app for quickly and easily resizing windows on your desktop.</p>
<p>3. <a href="https://apps.apple.com/ru/app/transporter/id1450874784?mt=12">Transporter</a></p>
<p mode="wrap">1/4 | <a href="/wap/eng/features-apps-for-macos-2.wml">Next &gt;&gt;</a><br/><a href="/wap/eng.wml">English</a><br/><a href="/wap/index.wml">Home</a></p>
</card>
